### AeroSphere REST API Integration Tests

### 1. Health Probe
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Search Domestic Indian Flights (DEL to BOM)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/flights/search?origin=DEL&destination=BOM&date=2026-10-25&cabin=Economy
Accept: application/json

### 3. Search Route BLR to DEL
GET http://localhost:8080/api/flights/search?origin=BLR&destination=DEL&date=2026-10-25
Accept: application/json

### 4. Explainable Delay Risk Prediction (Heuristic Evaluation)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/delay/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "DEL",
  "destination": "BOM",
  "departureTime": "19:30",
  "stops": 0,
  "airline": "SpiceJet",
  "aircraft": "Boeing 737-800"
}

### 5. Analytics Summary
GET http://localhost:8080/api/analytics/summary
Accept: application/json

### 6. Secured Trips (Without Token -> Expect 401 / 403)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trips
Accept: application/json

### 7. Secured Trips (With Firebase Bearer Token or Demo Token)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trips
Authorization: Bearer demo-rahul-sharma
Accept: application/json

### 8. Create Trip Itinerary (Secured)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/trips
Authorization: Bearer demo-rahul-sharma
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flightId": "AS-DEL-BOM-6E2041",
  "travelDate": "2026-10-25",
  "passengers": 1,
  "cabinClass": "Economy",
  "seat": "14B"
}
